{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13218270","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13218270","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1321827001:1":{"text":"可怜的孩子，前几天遇难的男人是她的父亲吗？","source_cn":"可怜的孩子，前几天遇难的男人是她的父亲吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A29254FFE9875A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1321827002:1":{"text":"愿艾雅保佑她，也愿她的父母在艾雅的国度得享安宁。","source_cn":"愿艾雅保佑她，也愿她的父母在艾雅的国度得享安宁。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CE5442AF95C7C92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321827003:1":{"text":"感谢您，奥格列修士，就请您把她父母的骸骨葬在一起吧。","source_cn":"感谢您，奥格列修士，就请您把她父母的骸骨葬在一起吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE2BDC482C39A790","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321827004:1":{"text":"我知道了。我会将他们安葬在教堂的墓地内。如果可以的话，葬礼就安排在明天早晨举行，我会亲自主持。","source_cn":"我知道了。我会将他们安葬在教堂的墓地内。如果可以的话，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE18A34BEC924B27E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321827005:1":{"text":"谢谢你……","source_cn":"谢谢你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x607C8D9152AAD51A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_t